## STRUGGLE SYSTEM — MYR CLUSTER WARS

### Overview
CK3 1.19 struggle framework. Three phases: Brewing → Ongoing → Ending. One faction accumulates sufficient struggle advantage to trigger the ending event. Each ending grants a unique empire-tier title to the winner and fires character-specific closing events.

**Ending threshold:** 80% struggle advantage for a single faction, OR 60% with two allied factions combined.

**Skrit recognition fires independently** of struggle phase — when Skrit obtains the duchy title, all top-level rulers receive `eotg_skrit_recognition_001` regardless of struggle state.

