### WIN CONDITION CLOSING EVENTS

**Win Condition 1 — The Freehold Compact** (`New Cauldron / Davan`)
*Canonical timeline outcome.* Davan receives a Senate address event. Iron Pact formalised as governing document. Client state titles distributed to allied factions. NC dominant, Warrens independent, Caliphate expelled, League dissolved.

**Win Condition 2 — The Soldier's Republic** (`7th Legion Independent`)
Legion board formally dissolved, replaced with civic council from officer ranks. Corven is first Consul. If Lyssa was player character: Nightglass Division becomes the Republic's constitutionally recognised intelligence body. `eotg_shadow_founder` modifier applied.

**Win Condition 3 — The Brass Compact** (`New Cauldron + Absorbed Legion`)
Same title as Win Condition 1 — intentional. Stronger version of the same state. Closing event: "Military Integration" — Lyssa's Nightglass files-on-senators problem surfaces immediately as a joint Davan/Corven/Lyssa policy event.

> **⚠ DE JURE FLIP (Win Conditions 1 and 3 when `eotg_legion_absorbed = yes`):**
